.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-packet\-dump \- List packets
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq packet dump\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIFILE\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
List packets.
.PP
Creates a human\-readable description of the packet sequence. Additionally, it can print cryptographic artifacts, and print the raw octet stream similar to hexdump(1), annotating specifically which bytes are parsed into OpenPGP values.
.PP
If the packet stream includes an encryption container, `sq` will attempt to decrypt it.
.PP


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Subcommand options"
.TP
\fB\-\-cert\fR=\fIFINGERPRINT|KEYID\fR
Dump the packets of the certificate with the specified fingerprint or key ID
.TP
\fB\-\-cert\-email\fR=\fIEMAIL\fR
Dump the packets of the certificate where a user ID includes the specified email address
.TP
\fB\-\-cert\-file\fR=\fIPATH\fR
Dump the packets of the cert read from PATH
.TP
\fB\-\-cert\-userid\fR=\fIUSERID\fR
Dump the packets of the certificate with the specified user ID
.TP
\fB\-\-hex\fR
Print a hexdump
.TP
\fB\-\-mpis\fR
Print cryptographic artifacts
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR=\fIFILE\fR
Write to FILE or stdout if omitted
.IP
[default: \fB\-\fR]
.TP
\fB\-\-recipient\-file\fR=\fIKEY_FILE\fR
Decrypt the message using the key in KEY_FILE
.TP
\fB\-\-session\-key\fR=\fISESSION\-KEY\fR
Decrypt an encrypted message using SESSION\-KEY
.TP
 \fIFILE\fR
Read from FILE or stdin if FILE is '\-'
.IP
[default: \fB\-\fR]
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
Print the packets of a certificate.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq packet dump juliet.pgp
.RE
.PP
.fi

.PP
Print the packets including cryptographic artifacts of a certificate.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq packet dump \-\-mpis juliet.pgp
.RE
.PP
.fi

.PP
Print the packets including a dump of every byte of a certificate.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq packet dump \-\-hex juliet.pgp
.RE
.PP
.fi

.PP
Prints the packets of an encrypted message, decrypting it using a secret
key file.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq packet dump \-\-recipient\-file bob\-secret.pgp message.pgp
.RE
.fi
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1), \fBsq\-packet\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
